# Credential files that AWS and other consoles hand you as a download.
# rootkey.csv landed in this directory once already.
rootkey.csv
accessKeys.csv
credentials.csv
*_accessKeys.csv
.aws/
*.pem
*.p12
id_rsa*

# Terraform
**/.terraform/*
*.tfstate
*.tfstate.*
terraform.tfstate.backup
crash.log
crash.*.log
*.tfvars
*.tfvars.json
!*.tfvars.example
# Environment configuration is sizing and feature flags, not secrets, and CI
# must read the same file a human does. Without these committed, a CI apply
# plans against variable defaults and tears down anything they turned on.
!environments/*/staging.tfvars
!environments/*/production.tfvars
!infra/terraform/environments/*/staging.tfvars
!infra/terraform/environments/*/production.tfvars
override.tf
override.tf.json
*_override.tf
*_override.tf.json
.terraformrc
terraform.rc

# The global gitignore (~/.gitignore_global) carries a blanket `*.md`, which
# silently excluded every README from this repository. A repo-level .gitignore
# takes precedence over the global one, so this re-includes them. The
# credential notes that rule was presumably aimed at stay excluded below.
!*.md
aws.md
github-tokens.md
ssh-keys.md

# Build artifacts
*.tsbuildinfo
